WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.670
Sign in with your company account.

5
00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:07.967
This recording uses fictional records, simulated location and a test camera.

9
00:00:07.967 --> 00:00:09.640
No live work is created.

13
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:15.218
The overview shows worker-started activity and the company review queue.

17
00:00:15.218 --> 00:00:17.540
You do not need to assign each job.

21
00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:23.645
Visit the app periodically, or use the configured daily summary to identify pending reviews.

25
00:00:24.445 --> 00:00:26.762
Manage your own workers in My team.

29
00:00:26.762 --> 00:00:31.130
Share a worker invitation, check registrations and approve access.

33
00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:35.829
Approved workers can start visits within your company’s contract sites.

37
00:00:36.629 --> 00:00:38.572
Open a submitted work record.

41
00:00:38.572 --> 00:00:44.536
Review the crew, each line and sub-line item, measured snow depth and service quantities.

45
00:00:44.536 --> 00:00:48.557
Compare original attendance with the worker’s claimed hours.

49
00:00:49.357 --> 00:00:52.776
Open before and after photos in the private gallery.

53
00:00:52.776 --> 00:00:56.064
Check ruler evidence against the confirmed inches.

57
00:00:56.064 --> 00:01:00.996
Review location links and resolve reported issues with a clear explanation.

61
00:01:01.796 --> 00:01:05.684
Approve only after checking the services, hours and evidence.

65
00:01:05.684 --> 00:01:10.081
Acknowledge the below-two-inch flag after inspecting the ruler photo.

69
00:01:10.081 --> 00:01:14.224
Forward the record to NPI, or request a correction with a reason.

73
00:01:14.224 --> 00:01:17.474
Company approval does not replace NPI verification.

77
00:01:18.274 --> 00:01:21.462
Set your company’s recipient emails in Settings.

81
00:01:21.462 --> 00:01:25.779
Daily summaries are off by default; enable them only when wanted.

85
00:01:25.779 --> 00:01:30.362
Immediate issue alerts and queued email status remain available here.

89
00:01:30.362 --> 00:01:34.081
A verified sender and scheduled dispatcher are required.
